Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.36,0:00:10.07,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs20\fad(146,1)\bord2.5\fnTimes New Roman\c&HEAF0EC&\3c&H3D5B3F&\pos(395.5,20)}Yuki Yokoya
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.53,0:00:10.07,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I am Yuki Yokoya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.48,0:00:12.19,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.19,0:00:14.63,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Please call me Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.30,0:00:19.05,Default,HOMEROOM TEACHER,0,0,0,,Apparently, she's Yokoya's cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.05,0:00:23.33,Default,HOMEROOM TEACHER,0,0,0,,There's a seat open right in front of him, \Nso please be seated there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.82,0:00:25.47,Default,CLASSMATES,0,0,0,,She's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.04,0:00:29.08,Default,CLASSMATES,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.16,0:00:37.22,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I look forward to taking classes \Nwith you, Master Hitoyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.01,0:00:42.98,Default,CLASSMATE,0,0,0,,What?! {\i1}Master{\i0} Hitoyoshi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:44.44,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, man...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.50,0:00:50.94,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki! Big Brother! How was school?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.94,0:00:54.86,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs14\fnTimes New Roman\bord2\c&HEEF3EB&\3c&H5D574E&\pos(631,116.5)}Ogiso Private High School
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.77,0:01:00.54,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,This was all {\i1}your{\i0} doing, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.37,0:01:06.11,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Nya-ha-ha! Consider yourself surprised!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.11,0:01:08.07,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Riko!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.32,0:01:12.64,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,But, you know... Ms. Yuki really is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.64,0:01:15.01,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,She's a lightning-fast learner!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.01,0:01:18.13,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,I ran out of things to teach her \Nafter three days!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.13,0:01:21.43,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Toward the end, she was even \Ndoing my homework for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.71,0:01:23.02,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.41,0:01:28.57,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Miss Riko praised me so much that \NI couldn't help but get a little carried away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.57,0:01:30.49,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.49,0:01:33.48,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Wait, I still have a lot of questions!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.48,0:01:35.94,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Like, how did you transfer in?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.94,0:01:37.97,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Where'd you pull the whole cousins thing from?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.97,0:01:40.44,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,And why'd you say your last name is Yokoya?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.44,0:01:43.47,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Not to mention, how are you \Nin the same grade as me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.78,0:01:48.50,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,And above all, why didn't you tell me \Nabout any of this? Stuff like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.61,0:01:54.67,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I was able to transfer in by pulling a few \Nstrings through my underground connections.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.67,0:01:57.70,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,The cousins setup was suggested by Miss Riko.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.70,0:02:01.47,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,She said I would be more easily accepted \Nif I claimed to be a relative.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.47,0:02:06.73,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,And since I am now your cousin, \NI borrowed the name Yokoya from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.73,0:02:10.38,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I think I am a little older than you,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.38,0:02:15.20,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,but I thought being in the same grade \Nwould better allow me to serve you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.52,0:02:19.45,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,And as for why I kept it all a secret, \Nthat was because...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.45,0:02:23.16,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Miss Riko said it would be more fun this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.16,0:02:24.83,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.83,0:02:26.20,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Riko...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.20,0:02:27.50,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Seriously, I can't believe you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.50,0:02:28.43,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.43,0:02:30.12,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Uh... Um.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.43,0:02:34.84,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Have I done something to upset you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.84,0:02:41.46,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, no, it's not that I'm angry, \Nmore just... a little surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.19,0:02:47.52,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ah, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.85,0:02:51.65,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Let's enjoy a normal school life \Ntogether, Ms. Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.57,0:02:55.48,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes, let's!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.50,0:04:41.21,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(688,1)\fs14\fnTimes New Roman\bord2\c&HEEF3EB&\3c&H5D574E&\pos(469,240.5)}Ogiso Private High School
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.88,0:04:41.21,Default,TAIGA'S VOICE,0,0,0,,Aw, yeah! It's finally time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.71,0:04:43.13,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fnTimes New Roman\c&HDEDDD9&\3c&H4A4644&}Katsuda Love
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.99,0:04:44.01,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,Here I come, Katsuda Bread!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.51,0:04:46.22,DefaultTop,TAIGA,0,0,0,,Outta the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.51,0:04:48.22,Signs_EpTitle,CAPTION,0,0,0,,{\fad(273,1)\pos(604.5,285.5)\blur1}Episode {\c&H1227CD&}4{\c&H000000&}: {\c&H1227CD&}You{\c&H000000&} Won't Miss Out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.22,0:04:48.22,DefaultTop,YUKI,0,0,0,,Katsuda... Bread...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.60,0:04:50.70,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki, what do you want to do for lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.70,0:04:53.53,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I was thinking of going to the \Nconvenience store, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.53,0:04:55.24,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Katsuda... Bread...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.24,0:04:57.53,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,What?! You want Katsuda Bread?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.54,0:05:03.65,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,But it's in such rare supply, you need to \Ndash for it the moment the bell rings...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.54,0:05:05.65,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Rare...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.65,0:05:08.82,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,You see, the Katsuda Side \NDish Store closes early,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.14,0:05:12.70,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,and there's no way for students \Nto make it there in time after school.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.70,0:05:19.24,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,So instead, our school store serves a selection\Nof their bread-based items each Wednesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.24,0:05:21.92,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,And the most popular one among them...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.45,0:05:25.56,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,is yakisoba bread with plenty \Nof Katsuda's Sauce mixed inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.56,0:05:27.37,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,commonly known as Katsuda Bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.37,0:05:29.55,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Personally, I'm more of a \NKatsuda Sandwich fan, though.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.55,0:05:32.38,DefaultTop,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Thing is, our classroom is the farthest one \Nfrom the school store,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.35,0:05:35.06,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs24\fnComic Sans MS\c&H2E312F&\move(116,167.56,116,72,21,4693)\bord2\3c&HFCFDFF&}Schoolyard
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.35,0:05:35.06,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs22\fnComic Sans MS\c&H2413C0&\move(262,162.56,262,67,21,4693)\3c&HFCFDFF&}School Store
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.35,0:05:35.06,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs24\fnComic Sans MS\c&H2E312F&\move(208.5,322.06,208.5,226.5,21,4693)\bord2\3c&HFCFFFC&}B Wing
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.35,0:05:35.06,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs24\fnComic Sans MS\c&H2E312F&\move(493.5,318.06,493.5,222.5,21,4693)\bord2\3c&HFCFFFC&}A Wing
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.35,0:05:35.06,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs24\fnComic Sans MS\c&H2E312F&\move(236,378.56,236,283,21,4693)\bord2\3c&HEFEFEF&}Pool
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.35,0:05:35.06,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs24\fnComic Sans MS\c&H2E312F&\move(478.5,371.06,478.5,275.5,21,4693)\bord2\3c&HEFEFEF&}Gymnasium
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.38,0:05:35.06,DefaultTop,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,so even if we leave now, \Nwe'll never make it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.64,0:05:37.63,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Katsuda... Bread...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.36,0:05:39.52,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Where is the school store?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.79,0:05:40.65,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.65,0:05:43.38,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,My mentor taught me something once.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.38,0:05:46.99,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,"Even if your prey should strike you, \Ndo not fail to take it down."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.81,0:05:49.95,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Please do not worry, Master Hitoyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.27,0:05:53.45,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I will obtain this Katsuda Bread without fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.43,0:05:55.70,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I shall return!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.66,0:05:59.42,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,M-Ms. Yuki?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.41,0:06:06.68,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Wait! Hold on, Ms. Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.68,0:06:08.97,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,If you stand out too much... \Nwe'll have a huge problem...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.97,0:06:10.55,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,on our hands...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.93,0:06:19.08,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I let her go off on her own again...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.08,0:06:22.65,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,No, I couldn't have stopped her. \NThere was no way I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.05,0:06:24.07,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.35,0:06:25.53,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Her face was...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.53,0:06:28.86,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,the face of a girl in a dessert shop!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.29,0:06:30.57,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I know this all too well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.57,0:06:32.64,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,In the pursuit of delicious desserts,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.64,0:06:35.98,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,the means, the effort, the cost—\Nnone of that matters!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.98,0:06:41.16,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,It's no exaggeration to say that a girl's true\Npotential is brought out in such moments!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.58,0:06:42.67,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,What that means is...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.67,0:06:47.55,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,If it's her desire and willpower to taste \NKatsuda's Sauce that's driving her right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.04,0:06:47.55,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(614,1)\bord2\fnTimes New Roman\c&H36434D&\3c&HE9EFEE&\an7}Katsuda's Sauce
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.89,0:06:50.64,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,None on this earth can stop her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.28,0:06:55.14,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,The concept of "normal" within Ms. Yuki \Nhas veered off in an unexpected direction!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.07,0:06:57.15,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.15,0:06:59.44,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,the first wave of the Katsuda Brigade!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.52,0:07:08.49,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(190,1)\bord2\fnTimes New Roman\c&HDEDDD9&\3c&H4A4644&}Katsuda Love
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.93,0:07:03.57,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,No one asked me, but clever little Riko \Nis going to explain it to you anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.57,0:07:05.21,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,The Katsuda Brigade are those who,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.21,0:07:10.00,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,captivated by the Katsuda Side Dish Store's \Nfood, will travel any distance to seize it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.53,0:07:24.92,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(858,1)\bord2\fnTimes New Roman\c&HDEDDD9&\3c&H4A4644&\pos(80.5,19.5)}Katsuda Love
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.98,0:07:24.92,DefaultTop,KATSUDA CULT,0,0,0,,Katsuda! Katsuda!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.00,0:07:12.95,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,They are soldiers who put their lives \Non the line for Katsuda Bread,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.95,0:07:17.71,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,training their leg strength and \Nsprinting ability each and every day!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.71,0:07:20.54,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,What's more, their love for \NKatsuda Bread runs so deep
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.54,0:07:24.92,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,that they perform a mysterious dance \Nwhile savoring its flavor!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.92,0:07:27.13,Default,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,This is bad! At this rate...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.38,0:07:29.56,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki, who's about to drop in from above,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.56,0:07:32.97,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,is going to clash with the Katsuda Brigade \Nright in front of the school store!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.97,0:07:35.80,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I can see the future, and it's not pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.15,0:07:40.18,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,She's leaping the distance?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.66,0:07:42.94,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.12,0:07:47.20,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Though... This might actually...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.87,0:08:02.75,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(152,1)\fs16\bord2\c&H524542&\3c&HD0C2B9&\pos(497.5,231.5)}Croquette Bread
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.04,0:08:02.75,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(152,1)\fs16\bord2\c&H524542&\3c&H92BFB5&\pos(408,211)}Egg Sandwich
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.16,0:08:02.75,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(152,1)\fs16\bord2\c&H524542&\3c&HD0C2B9&\pos(329,231.5)}Sandwich
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.37,0:08:02.75,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(152,1)\fs16\bord2\c&H524542&\3c&H92BFB5&\pos(205.5,231.5)}Yakisoba Bread
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.62,0:08:02.75,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(152,1)\fs16\bord2\c&H524542&\3c&HD0C2B9&\pos(70,231.5)}Katsu Sandwich
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.27,0:08:12.39,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,May I please have one Katsuda Bread \Nand one Katsuda Sandwich?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.98,0:08:20.12,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I can't possibly apologize enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.94,0:08:25.27,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,They said the Katsuda Side Dish Store bread \Nis limited to one per person, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.50,0:08:33.63,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I'm fine with this croquette bread here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.63,0:08:34.74,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.57,0:08:44.04,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Would you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.04,0:08:46.15,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,dine upon this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.42,0:08:49.71,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,No... Why don't you eat it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.46,0:08:54.55,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Is it truly all right for me \Nto be the only one to do so?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.90,0:08:57.93,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Yeah, go ahead. I've had it before, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.30,0:09:00.39,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,And you won it fair and square.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.76,0:09:02.26,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.26,0:09:06.35,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I was going to call out her outrageous \Nbehavior from earlier, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.93,0:09:10.32,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,When I see that blissful look on her face,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.74,0:09:13.54,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I can't bring myself to rain on her parade.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.00,0:09:22.41,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.96,0:09:24.83,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Please have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.83,0:09:25.71,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.44,0:09:29.08,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,That'd be... Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.67,0:09:32.28,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Please! There's no need to hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.56,0:09:38.22,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Then... if you'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.40,0:09:42.76,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.38,0:09:46.36,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,It's very...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.21,0:09:49.66,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,d-delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.82,0:09:58.24,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fad(690,1)\fs12\fnTimes New Roman\c&H4A4344&\3c&H8C7D7C&\bord2\fay-0.2\pos(296,253.5)}Yokoya
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.24,0:10:02.12,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Mochita, I'm sleeping over today!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.46,0:10:05.53,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Didn't you already visit a whole lot \Nduring summer vacation?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.53,0:10:07.08,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.08,0:10:11.88,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,I know Ms. Yuki can do it with you \Nany night she wants, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.88,0:10:13.06,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Watch your wording!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.06,0:10:15.65,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,This is a big deal for someone like me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.65,0:10:17.67,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,who's been wanting \Na big sister this whole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.06,0:10:21.74,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,We can chat about fashion, \Nstay up all night talking about love,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.74,0:10:23.78,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,secretly eat late-night snacks...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.78,0:10:26.31,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,The possibilities are endless!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.31,0:10:29.23,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Just so you know, I wanted \Na big sister so badly that...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.23,0:10:35.02,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,at one point, I almost tried to trick myself \Nin believing you were my big sister instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.02,0:10:37.48,Flashback,RIKO,0,0,0,,Big Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.07,0:10:39.01,Flashback,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,My dear Riko.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.01,0:10:39.66,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Who the heck?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.66,0:10:41.95,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,And you better rein in that wild imagination!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.95,0:10:42.83,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.83,0:10:44.83,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Clever little Riko just thought of an idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.46,0:10:50.57,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,If you and Ms. Yuki got married, \Neverything would work out perfectly!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.57,0:10:52.63,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Why am I the one getting carried off?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.63,0:10:54.64,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Huh? Cuz I prefer it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.64,0:10:55.74,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,You're honest, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.74,0:10:59.59,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,But if you ask me... I think Ms. Yuki is \Nin love with you, Big Brother! For sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.59,0:11:00.63,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.63,0:11:03.30,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Wait, wait. There's no way that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.30,0:11:05.76,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I don't think she's into \Nromance in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.76,0:11:10.48,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Nuh-uh. Who do you think understands \Na girl's heart better, you or me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.28,0:11:14.61,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,B-But... The other day...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.61,0:11:17.12,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,she gave me some Katsuda Bread \Nwith total innocence in her eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.12,0:11:19.07,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,There was nothing romantic about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.07,0:11:23.78,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,You kidding me? That's so lovey-dovey! She's \Ngotta be {\i1}this{\i0} close to popping the question!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.05,0:11:25.30,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Got plans for the wedding?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.30,0:11:26.98,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Don't get ahead of yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.98,0:11:28.87,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.36,0:11:32.06,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,I know Mom would probably be okay with it,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.06,0:11:33.89,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,but I dunno about Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.89,0:11:37.08,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,He's pretty stubborn, just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.08,0:11:38.90,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,In either case, I have no—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.90,0:11:41.55,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,We should hold both Eastern- \Nand Western-style weddings!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.41,0:11:44.85,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Is someone getting married?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.26,0:11:47.00,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, uh... No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.00,0:11:50.54,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,We were talking about how nice it would be \Nif you could become my big sister for real!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.54,0:11:51.35,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Riko!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.62,0:11:54.12,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,You like my big brother, don't you, Ms. Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.12,0:11:56.31,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Riko, you little...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.14,0:12:00.83,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes, I admire him dearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.41,0:12:06.93,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Oh, Ms. Yuki! I want to eat a persimmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.93,0:12:08.53,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Could you please peel it for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.53,0:12:09.32,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.22,0:12:15.49,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Hey... I've been wondering \Nthis for a while, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.49,0:12:17.63,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,You don't usually wear makeup, \Ndo you, Ms. Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.63,0:12:25.72,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fnTimes New Roman\fs10\c&H9C8E83&\3c&H1E1F1D&\pos(590.5,329)}Katsuda's Sauce
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.25,0:12:22.78,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,My apologies for my unsightly appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.78,0:12:25.72,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,During the day, I wear some \Nbasic foundation, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.72,0:12:30.33,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,What? Every girl dreams of being able \Nto look that good without makeup!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.33,0:12:32.92,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,I wish I could look that cute, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.92,0:12:34.49,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.02,0:12:40.94,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I can't say I've found my appearance \Nto be of much benefit in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.94,0:12:42.27,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,That's a good point!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.27,0:12:45.45,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Beauty like yours, Ms. Yuki, \Ncomes with its own share of troubles!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.45,0:12:49.45,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,In my case, my face doesn't really stand out...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.45,0:12:53.33,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,But when I grow older, I'm going to buy \Nlots of makeup and make myself cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.33,0:12:57.54,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I like your face, Miss Riko.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.06,0:13:02.80,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,It's adorable, and expressive, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.24,0:13:04.59,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,R-Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.23,0:13:05.93,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.49,0:13:09.01,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,That makes me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.01,0:13:12.85,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,I don't usually hear that from \Npeople besides Mom and Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.24,0:13:16.56,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Do you think I could become \Nas beautiful as you, Ms. Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.51,0:13:19.06,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.06,0:13:21.30,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,ever since I discovered tonkatsu sauce...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.30,0:13:24.04,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I feel like my skin has become smoother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.04,0:13:24.69,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.00,0:13:26.99,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,If you'd like, please try it for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.51,0:13:33.58,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Is this actually good?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.58,0:13:36.54,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I think it brings out the sweetness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.54,0:13:38.45,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Like when you put salt on watermelon?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.45,0:13:40.00,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,You might have a point!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.59,0:13:45.47,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Oh! This works surprisingly well!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.47,0:13:49.16,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,If you ask me, you guys \Nseem like sisters already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.26,0:13:54.25,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I'm sure it's thanks to Riko that she was \Nable to adapt so easily into our daily life,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.86,0:13:58.34,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,and it might be best \Nfor girls to stick together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.90,0:14:03.00,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Hey, Big Brother! I bet you just thought, \N"If I marry Ms. Yuki in the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.00,0:14:07.46,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,I'll be able to see this side of her every day,\Nwon't I?" or something like that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.46,0:14:08.41,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.04,0:14:13.87,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Marriage? I'm afraid I'm not \Nfamiliar with such things...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.30,0:14:16.33,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Please don't pressure me even harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.64,0:14:20.30,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,In Japan, once Big Brother turns eighteen, \Nhe can get married!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.30,0:14:23.32,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Then you can officially \Nbecome a Yokoya, Ms. Yuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.32,0:14:24.58,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Oh, is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.58,0:14:25.63,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Don't put ideas in her head!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.05,0:14:30.41,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you be happy, too, \Nif you could have a bride like Ms. Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.41,0:14:31.09,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.48,0:14:33.93,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Just hypothetically!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.40,0:14:39.77,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Well... Y-Yeah, I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.23,0:14:45.15,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Yay! He's committed now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.15,0:14:46.19,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Riko?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.78,0:14:49.92,DefaultTop,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ugh, just be quiet already!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.91,0:14:47.94,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.94,0:14:49.94,Default,RIKO,0,0,0,,Can't take it back now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.78,0:14:57.37,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fs14\fnTimes New Roman\bord2\c&HEEF3EB&\3c&H5D574E&\pos(469,240.5)}Ogiso Private High School
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.79,0:14:57.37,Default,LITERATURE TEACHER,0,0,0,,All right, quiet down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.80,0:15:00.67,Default,LITERATURE TEACHER,0,0,0,,"I am a cat,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.14,0:15:02.98,Default,LITERATURE TEACHER,0,0,0,,but as yet I have no name."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.98,0:15:06.08,Default,LITERATURE TEACHER,0,0,0,,"Where I was born is entirely unknown to me."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.08,0:15:09.94,DefaultTop,LITERATURE TEACHER,0,0,0,,"But this still dimly lives in my memory."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.72,0:15:14.93,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,That darn Riko barely \Nleft us alone all weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.94,0:15:12.52,DefaultTop,LITERATURE TEACHER,0,0,0,,"I was mewing in a gloomy, damp place,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.52,0:15:17.35,DefaultTop,LITERATURE TEACHER,0,0,0,,where I got the first sight \Nof a creature called man."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.93,0:15:16.34,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Now, thanks to that...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.80,0:15:20.24,Default,LITERATURE TEACHER,0,0,0,,Basically, from the point of view \Nof an anthropomorphized cat,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.24,0:15:24.56,Default,LITERATURE TEACHER,0,0,0,,it portrays the strangeness of things we \Nconsider common sense in human society, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.56,0:15:26.78,Default,LITERATURE TEACHER,0,0,0,,You there! Don't you dare fall asleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.98,0:15:39.04,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,This wasn't what I intended!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.77,0:15:43.21,Default,LITERATURE TEACHER,0,0,0,,The chalk... split in two?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.26,0:15:43.26,DefaultTop,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,My eyes... My eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.21,0:15:47.00,Default,TAIGA,0,0,0,,That can't be, right? \NIt was totally together, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.99,0:15:45.58,DefaultTop,YUKI,0,0,0,,My apologies!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.12,0:15:52.97,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oww...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.97,0:16:00.93,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\bord2\fs24\fnArial Black\pos(439.5,39.5)\c&H5A5A57&\3c&H13130E&}Infirmary
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.19,0:15:57.91,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I told her it was strictly prohibited \Nto bring knives to school, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.91,0:15:59.99,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,I wonder if she doesn't feel \Nat ease without them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.28,0:16:02.71,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.11,0:16:05.65,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I got chalk in my eye...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.17,0:16:09.18,Default,NITTA,0,0,0,,Oh, my, a new patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.90,0:16:13.78,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Huh? What happened to Nurse Maruyama?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.78,0:16:17.68,Default,NITTA,0,0,0,,I'm Nitta. I'll be filling in \Nas school nurse from today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.68,0:16:18.80,Default,NITTA,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.41,0:16:24.03,Default,NITTA,0,0,0,,So, what's wrong with your eye?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.03,0:16:25.13,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.13,0:16:27.86,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I got hit in both eyes by pieces of chalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.86,0:16:29.55,Default,NITTA,0,0,0,,A whole piece? In both eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.93,0:16:31.90,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,It's a long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.13,0:16:34.22,Default,NITTA,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.87,0:16:38.33,Default,NITTA,0,0,0,,If that's the case, could you please \Nsit on the bed right there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.33,0:16:39.42,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.72,0:16:45.09,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,She's pretty mysterious\Nfor a school nurse.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.09,0:16:48.72,Default,NITTA,0,0,0,,Is that pretty girl a friend of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.72,0:16:50.48,Default,NITTA,0,0,0,,Or your girlfriend, even?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.48,0:16:51.21,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.21,0:16:53.94,Default,NITTA,0,0,0,,The girl who wears a bell around her neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.44,0:16:58.26,Default,NITTA,0,0,0,,I just happened to see you two \Narrive together this morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.26,0:16:59.83,Default,NITTA,0,0,0,,so I was a little curious about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.43,0:17:02.88,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, do you mean Ms. Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.45,0:17:06.86,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Yeah, she's a friend of mine... \Nor, well, my cousin, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.86,0:17:08.04,Default,NITTA,0,0,0,,Your cousin?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.27,0:17:12.38,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Did I say something funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.38,0:17:15.86,Default,NITTA,0,0,0,,No, I was just thinking \Nhow you look nothing alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.26,0:17:18.66,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Well, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.66,0:17:23.43,Default,NITTA,0,0,0,,But I'd say someone like you is more my type.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.43,0:17:27.97,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Huh? Th-Thank you very... much?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.97,0:17:30.88,Default,NITTA,0,0,0,,Seriously, you're like a small animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.88,0:17:34.15,Default,NITTA,0,0,0,,It doesn't seem like there's \Nany damage to your eyeballs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.58,0:17:36.94,Default,NITTA,0,0,0,,Now, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.54,0:17:51.92,Default,NITTA,0,0,0,,Shall I check to see if there's \Nanything {\i1}else{\i0} wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.92,0:17:52.94,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.70,0:17:56.54,Default,NITTA,0,0,0,,My dear Hitoyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.98,0:18:13.07,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Wait! Wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.07,0:18:16.82,Default,NITTA,0,0,0,,You're so cute when you're frightened.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.14,0:18:20.14,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Where did all this come from?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.83,0:18:23.71,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Even erotic manga have more \Nemotional buildup than this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.70,0:18:26.12,Default,NITTA,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.12,0:18:28.65,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Besides, how do you know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.65,0:18:32.09,Default,NITTA,0,0,0,,I'm going to give you the \Nbest first time ever...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.09,0:18:33.34,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.34,0:18:35.14,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Are your eyes all right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.98,0:18:39.59,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,I came as quickly as I could \Nafter class ended, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.59,0:18:39.72,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\blur0.3\fs15\an9\c&H554339&\pos(413.5,41.5)}Make sure to wash your\Nhands and gargle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.72,0:18:39.76,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\blur0.3\fs15\an9\c&H554339&\pos(413.5,41.5)\clip(m 239 32 l 350 34 364 81 235 89)}Make sure to wash your\Nhands and gargle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.55,0:18:46.02,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\blur1\fs10\an9\c&H72674F&\frz350.8\fax0.15\pos(111,65)}Make sure to wash your\Nhands and gargle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.55,0:18:46.44,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Oh, Ms. Yuki! I was so scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.02,0:18:49.44,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fs10\an9\c&H554339&\pos(696.5,113)}Make sure to wash your\Nhands and gargle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.44,0:18:48.59,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,What happened, Master Hitoyoshi?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.78,0:18:55.19,Default,NITTA,0,0,0,,Oh, come on! That was just a joke. \NA school nurse joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.19,0:18:58.04,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Think about the scar you're leaving \Non this young boy's heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.04,0:19:03.09,Default,NITTA,0,0,0,,But you're so cute. You're like a hamster, \Nall nibbles and squeaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.09,0:19:04.12,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.46,0:19:07.33,Default,NITTA,0,0,0,,Right? Don't you agree,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.64,0:19:08.94,Default,NITTA,0,0,0,,Ms. "Yuki"?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.52,0:19:13.87,Default,NITTA,0,0,0,,I'll give you some eye drops, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.87,0:19:14.95,Default,NITTA,0,0,0,,Come on over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.76,0:19:18.61,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Please, no more weird "jokes," okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.61,0:19:23.14,Default,NITTA,0,0,0,,Oh, look at you quiver. \NYou're so cute, I could eat you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.14,0:19:25.72,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,That's exactly the kind of thing \NI want you to stop doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.14,0:19:26.10,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\fs16\an9\c&H857768&\pos(630.5,27.5)}Make sure to wash your\Nhands and gargle!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.56,0:19:27.22,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.70,0:19:34.73,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki... You, too? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.73,0:19:36.23,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I don't get—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.42,0:19:38.68,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.07,0:19:41.39,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,stay away from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.39,0:19:43.57,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,What? Does that mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.57,0:19:46.59,FlashbackItalics,RIKO {flashback},0,0,0,,If you ask me... I think Ms. Yuki is \Nin love with you, Big Brother! For sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.59,0:19:49.64,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Wait, wait! Does this mean that...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.28,0:19:53.30,DefaultItalics,HITOYOSHI {M},0,0,0,,Ms. Yuki is jealous?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.47,0:19:57.46,Default,NITTA,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.27,0:20:03.01,Default,NITTA,0,0,0,,It doesn't seem like a serious injury, \Nbut if the pain becomes severe,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.01,0:20:05.68,Default,NITTA,0,0,0,,please be sure to go see a doctor \Nas soon as possible, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.64,0:20:12.08,Default,NITTA,0,0,0,,My dear Hitoyoshi... and Ms. Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.56,0:20:21.18,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,M-Ms. Yuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.47,0:20:25.62,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,Master Hitoyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.09,0:20:27.11,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,Yesh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.11,0:20:31.43,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,My apologies for earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.98,0:20:33.83,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,For suddenly pulling you in close like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.83,0:20:37.34,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,W-Well, I guess it did surprise me a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.46,0:20:42.01,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,There is something \NI must tell you, Master Hitoyoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.01,0:20:44.97,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,What?! Um, is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.97,0:20:49.22,Signs,SCREENCAP,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\bord2\c&H2C2B2C&\3c&HA3E1EC&}Big Brother   Big Brother   Big Brother   Big Brother   Big Brother
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.37,0:20:48.51,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,I-I haven't mentally prepared myself yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.76,0:20:55.44,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,That woman from earlier... \NShe is in the same business as me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.06,0:21:00.60,Default,YUKI,0,0,0,,There's no doubt she's an assassin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.60,0:21:01.38,Default,HITOYOSHI,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.11,0:21:16.87,Default,NITTA,0,0,0,,And here I thought you were here on work.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.45,0:21:26.01,Default,NITTA,0,0,0,,I'll crush your little pretend family for you.
